UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::constructor
├── when the leaf voter is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the leaf voter reports a zero factory registry
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the leaf voter reports a zero gauge manager
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when the leaf voter reports nonzero links
    ├── it should set the leaf voter
    ├── it should set the factory registry reported by the leaf voter
    └── it should set the gauge manager reported by the leaf voter

UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::activate
├── when the factory registry records no target for the gauge
│   └── it should revert with GaugeNotRegistered
└── when the gauge has a recorded target
    ├── when the first pool token is not listed
    │   └── it should revert with TokenNotListed carrying the first token
    ├── when the second pool token is not listed
    │   └── it should revert with TokenNotListed carrying the second token
    └── when both pool tokens are listed
        ├── it should allow any caller
        ├── it should read the live token registry pointer from the factory registry
        └── it should activate the gauge through the gauge manager

UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::addListedBaseAsset
├── when the caller does not hold the module admin role on the leaf voter
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
└── when the caller holds the module admin role on the leaf voter
    ├── when the token is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
    ├── when the token is not in the set
    │   ├── it should add the token to the set
    │   └── it should emit ListedBaseAssetAdded
    └── when the token is already in the set
        ├── it should succeed
        ├── it should keep the token in the set
        └── it should not emit ListedBaseAssetAdded

UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::removeListedBaseAsset
├── when the caller does not hold the module admin role on the leaf voter
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
└── when the caller holds the module admin role on the leaf voter
    ├── when the token is in the set
    │   ├── it should remove the token from the set
    │   └── it should emit ListedBaseAssetRemoved
    └── when the token is not in the set
        ├── it should succeed
        ├── it should leave the set unchanged
        └── it should not emit ListedBaseAssetRemoved

UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::addAllowedGaugeFactory
├── when the caller does not hold the module admin role on the leaf voter
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
└── when the caller holds the module admin role on the leaf voter
    ├── when the gauge factory is the zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
    ├── when the gauge factory is already allowed
    │   └── it should revert with GaugeFactoryAlreadyAllowed
    └── when the gauge factory is not yet allowed
        ├── it should add the gauge factory to the set
        ├── it should emit GaugeFactoryAllowed
        └── it should expose the gauge factory through the set views

UnitDefaultGaugeCreationModule::removeAllowedGaugeFactory
├── when the caller does not hold the module admin role on the leaf voter
│   └── it should revert with NotAuthorized
└── when the caller holds the module admin role on the leaf voter
    ├── when the gauge factory is not in the set
    │   └── it should revert with GaugeFactoryNotAllowed
    └── when the gauge factory is in the set
        ├── it should remove the gauge factory from the set
        ├── it should emit GaugeFactoryDisallowed
        └── it should hide the gauge factory from the set views
